    "Ranked by expected gain — the weekly chance times the room the staff can see. **%/wk** is the chance one week's extra reps produce a +1; **headroom** is how many points he still has under his ceiling, and it is a scouting read, not a fact. The room needs two seasons with a player before it names the number — one under an elite developer — so newer men show a range or a tier instead." : {
