    "Train %@ at %@?\nCurrent: %lld%% / Ceiling: %lld%%\nThis is a slow process that takes multiple seasons. At %lld%% familiarity the move becomes PERMANENT — he changes position for good and his ratings are rebuilt around %@. Stop the programme before then if you only want a backup there." : {
      "comment" : "A message box for the \"Start Position Training\" alert. The first argument is the player's name. The second argument is the position to train at. The third argument is the current level of familiarity with the position. The fourth argument is the maximum level of familiarity with the position. The fifth argument is the percentage at which a player's position is permanently changed.",
